#HSSS 1.0
TITLE: Ubuntu White Edition / D-Bus Specification
PACKAGE: dbus
LANGUAGE: C
STATUS: W1
ROLE: Inter-process communication and service activation

## PROGRAM
D-Bus provides system and user-session IPC buses and service activation used by desktop and system services.

## STRUCTURE
SOURCE: upstream D-Bus / Ubuntu package
BOUNDARY: client -> bus policy -> service activation -> service
WHITE_EDITION: policy, configuration, testing, documentation
GUI: JavaFX administration must use explicit authorization and supported interfaces

## SPEC
- preserve protocol compatibility
- keep bus policy explicit
- minimize privilege through activation
- separate system and user-session concerns
- make activation failures observable

## QUALITY
TEST: system bus, user bus, activation, denied request, policy reload, systemd interoperability, upgrade
ECONOMY: startup, resident memory, activation overhead, policy complexity

## SOURCE POLICY
D-Bus is primarily C. Native changes require concrete correctness/security evidence and regression coverage.
